WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.850 line:6% align:center
DRAFT — Your strategic assistant for League of Legends.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.200 line:6% align:center
Presentation and tutorial · version 2.16 beta.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.100 line:6% align:center
You see the enemy composition. Which champion from your pool should you pick?

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:17.700 line:6% align:center
DRAFT tells you and explains why. It never acts in the client: you always pick yourself.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.900 line:6% align:center
1. Launch DRAFT-Portable.exe   2. A DRAFT icon appears next to the clock

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:30.800 line:6% align:center
3. Right-click it: window, panels, settings. No key or account needed to start.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:37.322 line:6% align:center
Open settings from the DRAFT icon, then "My profiles".

00:00:37.322 --> 00:00:42.290 line:6% align:center
Choose a role and add your champions with the search.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:47.067 line:6% align:center
Each role keeps its own pool, saved automatically.

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:54.085 line:6% align:center
The five icons at the top of each window switch roles in one click.

00:00:54.085 --> 00:00:57.833 line:6% align:center
The active role is shown right next to them.

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:03.707 line:6% align:center
Type an enemy champion's name, then press Enter.

00:01:03.707 --> 00:01:08.535 line:6% align:center
DRAFT guesses its role: correct it in one click if needed.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:13.300 line:6% align:center
Your pool's ranking updates with each addition.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:20.612 line:6% align:center
Center: the best option from your pool, an alternative and the reason.

00:01:20.612 --> 00:01:25.344 line:6% align:center
Bottom: all your champions, ranked for this draft.

00:01:25.344 --> 00:01:31.100 line:6% align:center
Right: how to win, threats, targets and useful bans.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:36.856 line:6% align:center
Compact panels sit next to the client.

00:01:36.856 --> 00:01:42.267 line:6% align:center
They keep the essentials: enemies, ranking and game plan.

00:01:43.567 --> 00:01:48.207 line:6% align:center
Analysis: the criteria that separate your champions.

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:52.784 line:6% align:center
Compare: two of your champions against this draft.

00:01:52.784 --> 00:01:57.233 line:6% align:center
Tips: explanations matched to your level.

00:01:57.233 --> 00:02:02.700 line:6% align:center
Duel: what to pick against a specific mid laner, without touching your draft.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:09.822 line:6% align:center
The Riot API powers optional features, always started by you.

00:02:09.822 --> 00:02:15.963 line:6% align:center
To import your history: your Riot ID, your region, how many games.

00:02:15.963 --> 00:02:20.633 line:6% align:center
Your key is masked and never saved.

00:02:21.933 --> 00:02:27.200 line:6% align:center
History import, call by call: Riot ID → account-v1 → match-v5 → your PC.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:32.467 line:6% align:center
Kept: date, patch, champion, position, result, K/D/A, opponents.

00:02:32.467 --> 00:02:37.733 line:6% align:center
Key in the X-Riot-Token header, never saved. On a 429 response, DRAFT waits for Retry-After.

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:43.279 line:6% align:center
The Games tab summarizes your imported history.

00:02:43.279 --> 00:02:48.601 line:6% align:center
Your most played champions, without ever changing the ranking.

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:52.467 line:6% align:center
The data in this video is fictitious.

00:02:53.767 --> 00:02:59.567 line:6% align:center
No automation: no picking, no banning. What you see in champion select, plus per-champion stats.

00:02:59.567 --> 00:03:05.367 line:6% align:center
No data sent to a server. Client reading is optional and off by default. DRAFT isn't endorsed by Riot Games.

00:03:06.667 --> 00:03:09.317 line:6% align:center
DRAFT — Your strategic assistant for League of Legends.

00:03:09.317 --> 00:03:11.967 line:6% align:center
Private beta · simulated draft and fictitious data in this video.
